Package: tibercad
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: non-free/science
Priority: optional
Architecture: i386
Suggests: grace, gmsh
Depends: refblas3, lapack3, libboost-regex1.33.1, libboost-filesystem1.33.1
Installed-Size: %computed_size%
Maintainer: TiberCAD developers <developers@tibercad.org>
Description: Multiscale simulation of electronic and optoelectronic
 devices. Includes modules for calculation of strain, heat flow,
 drift-diffusion, quantum states.
